blockquote class=3D"gmail_quote" style=3D"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-l=
eft:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex">Hi Pascal,<br>
<br>
Thanks for the pointer to the draft.<br>
<br>
Since I am surveying implementations for the update of RFC 7925 (see <a hre=
f=3D"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-uta-tls13-iot-profile/" re=
l=3D"noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-i=
etf-uta-tls13-iot-profile/</a>) I was wondering whether there is an impleme=
ntation of this approach.<br>
<br>
